ind":"announcement","title":"Chivalware - November 5 Launch + Steam Next Fest Demo","summary":"Hello everyone! Max here again, AKA Regal Pigeon, with some news! After a long journey I’m beyond excited to let you know that I’ll be launching Chivalware on November 5 2026 - and the current demo will be participating in Steam Next Fest!I’m really excited to finally let you get stuck into Chivalware. The Steam Next Fest demo has the first three of five playable characters, including the Disk, Tank and Jester Knights. You can try 45 out of 80 weapon disks, 86 of over 150 upgrades and there are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:01:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3591900-1843481262701925","game_id":"steam-3591900","kind":"announcement","title":"CHIVALWARE - NEW DEMO + NEW GAMEPLAY TRAILER","summary":"Hello everyone! It’s Max, AKA Regal Pigeon, the developer behind Chivalware. I’m super excited to announce that a new demo is live now, with more content, new features, and many improvements since the first demo!To give you a taste of what awaits in this new demo and the full game, here’s a new commented gameplay trailer: DEMO NEW CONTENT AND FEATURESDisclaimerDue to the amount of balancing and new gameplay features, previous saves from the first demo have been deleted. Saves from demos will not","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T14:57:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3591900-1840944183777029","game_id":"steam-3591900","kind":"announcement","title":"CHIVALWARE - DEMO FEEDBACK","summary":"Hello everyone!It’s Max, AKA Regal Pigeon, the developer behind Chivalware. I’ve been reading your comments, reviews, and watching your playthroughs. They gave me some useful ideas for the final version of the game:More build agency & replayabilityI’m working on features that will increase player agency over their build before and during runs:An option to select a random weapon disk at the start of each runAn option to select between two beneficial deals (processor, chip, coins, energy, etc.) at","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T15:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777029","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3591900-1836506165562867","game_id":"steam-3591900","kind":"announcement","title":"CHIVALWARE - DEMO FEEDBACK","summary":"Hello everyone!It’s Max, AKA Regal Pigeon, the developer behind Chivalware. It’s been a few weeks since the release of the demo, and I wanted to thank all who wishlisted the game and especially those of you who left feedback on the demo - it’s been very rewarding and insightful!Follow the game on socialsX - Discord - https://discord.gg/U3YnTTu982","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T15:02:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562867","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3591900-1833968530898181","game_id":"steam-3591900","kind":"announcement","title":"CHIVALWARE - REVEAL | DEMO OUT NOW!","summary":"Hello everyone!I’m Max, a solo developer under the name Regal Pigeon Games. Today, I’m very excited to announce my new game, Chivalware, with its publishers: The Arcade Crew and Imperfect Games.ABOUT THE GAMEChivalware is a fast-paced action roguelite where you fight on a grid battlefield: as you evade constant enemy attacks, you must also match tiles to charge your weapons. The more tiles you match, the more times you can attack! You are a Disk Knight, a legendary warrior who wields weapon disk","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T16:55:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898181","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3591900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3591900":"2026-10-26T10:39:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3591900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:53Z"},"4207520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3591900","app_id":3591900,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c97dd536079c89161cd1ca1a8c63025f16c8a890c328b3f3913b5dab0cba49ea","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Chivalware는 미칠듯한 속도감을 자랑하는 타일 매치 액션 로그라이트입니다. 그리드 위에서 펼쳐지는 전투에서 여러분의 반사 신경과 운동 신경을 시험해 보세요. 적의 공격을 피하고, 타일을 매치해 무기를 충전하고, 절호의 공격 기회를 잡으세요!","publishers":[{"name":"The Arcade Crew"},{"name":"Imperfect Games"},{"name":"Dotemu","creator_clan_account_id":33098302}],"developers":[{"name":"Regal Pigeon"}],"franchise